{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIwLzEwMFVQJTIwJTI4MjAyMCUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"100UP","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/y1W6cEXgR2bGwaMaRc045IphGbS.jpg","description":"100UP is a film which investigates the will to live. It portrays a colourful selection of 100+ year old people from all over the world. They have lived for over a century and witnessed great historical events, but instead of dwelling on the past, they look ahead. With the clock inevitably ticking, these centenarians cling to life, set new goals with a joie de vivre, refusing to admit the betrayal of their deteriorating bodies. Time is both their enemy and their friend. They have overcome diseases, lost partners and some of them survived their own children. Nevertheless, these active, curious and creative 100+ year olds are amazingly good at restarting every new day.\n\nReleased 7 Jan 2021 · Netherlands · Language: English · 93 min\nStudio: Dutch Mountain Film, Savage Film, Tenk.tv\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2020","genres":["Documentary","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.8","imdb_id":"tt13154112","moviedb_id":767354,"tmdbId":767354,"runtime":"93 min","director":["Heddy Honigmann"],"released":"2021-01-07T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Age is just a number","country":"Netherlands","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Heddy Honigmann","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hAcQIVYwDxJA8ZSiaPh5ux1yIG3.jpg"}]},"trailers":[{"source":"4uMc-r4n8KE","type":"Trailer"}],"trailerStreams":[{"title":"Trailer: 100UP,  Doc Edge Festival 2021","ytId":"4uMc-r4n8KE"}],"links":[{"name":"Heddy Honigmann","category":"Director","url":"stremio:///search?search=Heddy%20Honigmann"},{"name":"Documentary","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///search?search=Documentary"},{"name":"Dutch Mountain Film","category":"Studio","url":"stremio:///search?search=Dutch%20Mountain%20Film"},{"name":"Savage Film","category":"St